what if you are the little man so I got  a great question from one of my loyal  YouTube viewers game ovah who wrote in  the say what if you are your own worst  little man and this is a fantastic  question and when I talk about the  little man it's usually talking about  somebody else you know the other people  in your life who hate on your idea to  tell you why it's not gonna work out  point out all the flaws in your plan but  often the little men can be yourself  right where you hate on yourself and you  tell yourself all the reasons why  something's not going to work and so how  do you overcome it so I give three  strategies to help you  number one is remember why why are you  doing this what is your main reason for  launching this company or for trying to  hit this big goal that you're going for  why is it important to you right is it  to build a better life for yourself or a  better life your family or to help  people whatever it is you need to have a  strong why right I want to help a  billion entrepreneurs that's a huge  number that that motivates me that  excites me and thinking about that helps  me overcome things that I might be  afraid of you know I might be afraid of  getting on the camera doing my first  video I might be afraid of doing a TV  interview I might be afraid of of  launching a new product whatever it is I  might be afraid but helping remember  that big why keeps me excited and  motivated so what is your big why then  if you don't have one then you're not  gonna have success in business right you  have to have a strong wife if you're  doing this just to make money it's not  going to work that's me something else  is driving you forward and so whenever  you're facing that self-criticism and  thinking I can never do this think about  that big why and what you're trying to  accomplish to give you some extra  motivation and courage to overcome  number two surround yourself with  greatness when you are down on yourself  it's important to have people and an  environment that supports you that makes  you feel great that makes you feel  invincible that makes you feel like you  can accomplish anything  so maybe it's a friend who believes in  you or a family member who says you can  do it or  in videos maybe my channel helps you or  some other channels for me it was  reading stories of famous entrepreneurs  and how they got started and had nothing  and and built themselves up when people  didn't believe in them but they believe  in themselves and and reading those  stories make me feel like if she can do  it if he can do it and I can do it too  and that gave me the courage to keep  going and to break out of my zone that  you sometimes get into where you feel  like like it's not gonna happen for you  so we didn't those stories helped me but  you want to surround yourself with  greatness whatever you can do to help  you stay inspired if it's listening to  music or watching interviews or reading  books whatever it is surround yourself  with greatness and number three is take  small steps a lot of times the  self-doubt comes in because you're here  and you want to go here and that looks  like too big a gap and you don't have  the skills or experience to get there  and so you criticize yourself you become  the little man you say I can never get  there but what you want to do is break  that down so that jump isn't as big so  you only have to go here and then you go  here and here and here and here and if  you've gone from here to here then  taking that step isn't that scary right  you say well I can't get here there's no  way I'm gonna get here but I can get  here I think I can get here so you can  do it and when you do it then you  realize hey you know what I can do that  again and I can go here now and I can go  here and I can go here so you're not  being your own worst enemy as much  because you're taking smaller steps but  still hitting that big goal so whatever  it is that you know you may get you may  say I could 